<title>FINLAND: Cultor 4-mth profit rises 2.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Cultor 4-mth profit rises 2.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to April 30-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		    50 vs 49</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.63 vs 1.49</p>
<p> Net sales					  2,521 vs 2,512</p>
<p> Operating profit				   101 vs 90</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of nine analysts' forecasts for Finnish foodstuffs, animal feed and bakery group Cultor Oy's January-April profit after financial items had been 60 million markka in a 50-75 million markka range.  </p>
<p> Net financial items			charge 51 vs 41 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			  gain 19 vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before taxes				 68 vs 49</p>
<p> Taxes						   12 vs 14</p>
<p> Minorities					   nil vs 1 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					    56 vs 34</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		36 vs 34</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Cultor Oy.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
